00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:51.510
Yeah, yeah, that's it!
Your feelings become more open.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.520
Being out here makes you want to
be more daring and care-free!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.950
Uh, yeah... I guess so...

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:57.950
That's the point!

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.700
This is the perfect place to find...

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:01.840
Love!

