00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.510
Oh yeah? Who?

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:38.500
How about Ume?

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:43.660
Ume... yeah, she's got big boobs.
But then I'd end up talking like her.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.190
What about Himejima, then?

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:50.880
No way, she's
way too masculine for me.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:54.000
How about Kuzuha?

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.540
Kuzuha?
Oh yeah, she'd be great!

00:03:57.030 --> 00:03:58.040
Forget about it.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:58.460
Eh?

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:01.730
Well, she seems kind of immature.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:05.140
And she's really clumsy too.

00:04:05.770 --> 00:04:08.040
Okay, who's left then?

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.110
