00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.260
Her family is super-rich!

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:13.190
Alright!

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:14.680
Akira, how about you?

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:16.780
