Cut it out Fujio.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.480
If you have time to
play around like this...

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.750
Would you like some help?

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:08.740
W... Why?!

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:10.370
In love with me?!

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:14.720
Yeah, I think Aoki was trying to tell
you that he is in love with you!

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:16.740
Oh come on, give me a break!

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.220
I'm a ma!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.980
Well, I mean... I'm a kyoshi.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.930
Well, that's all the more reason.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.770
Forbidden love between
a kyoshi and her student...

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.600
