00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:29.330
Love at resorts is so disposable!

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.520
Then you can dump
him when we get home!

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:32.450
What?!

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:34.650
Hibiki-chan!!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.730
Why don't ya take him?

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:40.270
Don't be stupid!!

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.800
Hibiki-chan!!

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.420
Stay away from me!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:48.610
Leave me alone!

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:51.150
But, I can't control myself!

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.200
Hibiki-chan!!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.360
Dog Stew

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:01.380
Gochiso

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:03.000
Gochiso, Rurugaoka Branch

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.830
Ba-chan, what are you doing here?

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:16.110
Well why shouldn't I be here?
I own all of these mountains.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:18.920
What?! Are you serious?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.610
Awesome!

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.550
So, how's your camping trip going?

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:25.930
Well, not so good.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.970
I'm tired of trying to be a woman.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:30.020
