00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:32.940
and I get chased around
by Aoki and his hormones.

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.390
I just can't take it.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:12.440
You have no skill.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.270
Fukae-kun.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:15.580
Give it here.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:21.010
You're really good, Fukae-kun.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.380
It was beaten into
me in the boy scouts.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.250
Wow, you're really good!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:29.640
Ouch!

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:31.890
Hold on.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:36.140
Don't make such a fuss.

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.860
But it'll get infected.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:38.680
It's nothing.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.520
I'm all right now.

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:46.500
I'll wash this,
then I'll give it back.

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.540
Bye-bye!
You guys were fun.

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:00.950
Bye-bye!

