00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:07.050
What?!

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:10.850
This place!
might be!!

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.430
Nagoya

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:22.200
Nagoya's Famous Kishimen Noodles

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:27.650
I know all of you had a lot of free
time today because we just got here...

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:29.510
