00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:32.790
OK, dismissed.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.200
Yes.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:37.980
Aoki!

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:40.120
Well, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:43.130
Why is she so embarrassed?

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.660
It's a women's heart...

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.160
I see.

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:51.690
This time I'll do it.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.850
Fujio, let's go.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.230
Oh, you guys go on ahead.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:59.180
Alright then. Goodnight.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:11.630
Kuzuha, Kuzuha.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:15.770
Huh?

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:17.820
What is it?

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:19.760
Come over here for a second.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.410
Can you give this to
