00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:23.530
What is it?

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.220
It's a love letter.

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:27.540
And give this to Hibiki-chan!

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:28.080
What?

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:29.660
Thanks a lot!

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:34.740
A love letter?

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:35.650
Yeah.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.460
Oh dear...

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:38.440
And that one?

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.110
It's for me, right?

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.450
See, I knew it was mine!

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:44.030
Oh, that one... is for...

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:48.500
"I'll wait for you at the
