00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:50.460
Oh, this one says...

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:54.230
"I'll be waiting for you in front
of the clock tower at 9:00 tonight."

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:55.820
Alright!

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:58.640
Vacation love affairs are disposable!

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:21.920
Fukae...

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:23.820
What is it?

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:27.080
Well... would you like
to go for a walk?

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:37.120
Aren't you afraid...
that a sensei might catch us here?

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:42.860
I'm sorry if I'm bothering you.
Were you busy?

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.280
Not really.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.010
I've got some time on my hands.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:48.920
I was wondering...

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:52.510
are you going to meet Aoki?

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:53.680
No way.

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:00.750
Thanks for waiting.

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.560
- Ume!? What are you here?
- Aoki!? What are you here?

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:39.470
Sensei...

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:40.510
Yes?

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:42.080
To be honest...

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:45.210
I didn't really know whether I
should tell you or not.

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:47.810
About the letter?

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:51.130
Yes. When
Aoki-kun gave it to me...

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:55.970
I felt this pain in my heart,
like it was being squeezed.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:02.990
I think it was supposed to
be a love letter for you.

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:05.370
And yet...

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:09.380
Even now, I'm still feeling that pain.

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:11.120
I just don't understand.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:16.120
Why does my heart race like
this whenever I think of you?

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.460
Am I... weird?

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.860
Well I don't think...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.040
Kuzuha...

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:35.710
Sensei...

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:22.350
It doesn't look like we can go back.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.040
Well...

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:36.910
It's terrible, isn't it?
This crazy mountain weather.

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:38.190
You must be cold.

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:40.550
Come sit down.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.090
I'm impressed that you
can make a fire like this.

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.600
It's no big deal.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:05.200
Huh?

00:14:08.520 --> 00:14:09.200
No!

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:52.080
Fukae!

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:53.000
Himejima!

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:55.790
Are you guys OK?

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:56.710
We're fine.

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.300
How shameful! What a scandal!

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:03.160
You're wrong!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:05.210
The two were just trying to avoid the rain.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.690
And you actually believe them?!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.900
A young man and a young girl
spent the night together!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.680
They must have been doing something!!

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:13.270
Ugh, how filthy!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:16.270
No it's not!
That's just a proof of love!!

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:18.940
What did you just say?

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:21.620
None of this matters, if they're
in love? Even in Jr. High?!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:23.530
No, I mean!

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.750
Say what you mean!!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.000
At any rate, today's
hike is cancelled.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:30.620
Instead, we will separate the boys
and girls and have sex education.

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.830
Girls, have you ever thought about...

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:38.060
what men are truly
looking for in women?

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:40.860
Their bodies.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:41.720
That's right!

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:44.430
The only thing men want is your body.

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:46.650
Young ladies as pretty as yourselves...

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:49.840
have surely been the victims
of gropers before, haven't you?

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.010
Yes.

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:55.080
I'm sure you've heard
this story before.

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:57.370
You go all the way with a man...

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:59.880
get pregnant and then he
changes his mind and?

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:00.970
Then he dumps you.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:02.210
Yes.

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:05.020
All men, deep down, are just animals!

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:08.420
They're cowardly beasts that run
away when things get too tough!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:09.100
Yes.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:11.580
Better to be safe than sorry.

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:14.060
You must defend yourselves
and protect your body!

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:18.540
Male praying mantises
are so pathetic.

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.700
Did you know that
once the mating is over...

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:24.130
the male mantis is killed
and eaten by the female?

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:25.970
Yeah, so what are you trying to say?

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:33.120
Take a moment to remember how
your mothers and fathers talk at home.

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:36.200
My mom is always yelling at my dad.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:39.530
She tells him all the time that he
doesn't make enough money.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:43.500
Fathers work hard for their families,
but they're never treated right.

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:47.170
When my dad's drunk,
he always complains about my mom.

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.860
"Getting married was the
biggest mistake of my life."

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.560
Women are horrible!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:52.640
Yeah.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.470
Now that you mention it...

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:59.050
didn't Akira spend
last night alone with Himejima?

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.220
Ahhh, very suspicious.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.680
And he claims that nothing
happened between them.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:05.710
Ahhh, very suspicious!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.190
You wanted to talk to me?

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.660
Sorry about all this.

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:12.890
I don't mind so much
because I'm a guy, but...

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:15.260
It's okay. I don't mind either.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.100
Don't worry.

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:19.730
Stupid rumors like this
always go away eventually.

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:24.890
Yeah...

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:26.890
I guess you're right.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:32.110
Gochiso

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:37.260
Damn her!

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:39.510
The Vice-Principal calls it sex ed...

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:42.270
but she's just trying to control
the student's love lives!

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:44.060
What about "Love is All", huh?

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:48.170
True love comes from
caring deeply for someone...

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:50.150
You can say that again.

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.520
Fukae and Himejima,
they're not a bad couple.

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:56.590
Good for them.

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.750
That's not good!

00:17:59.040 --> 00:17:59.910
Why not?

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:02.110
Well, because they're
only in junior high...

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:04.620
But even so, I still trust them.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.900
Look who's talking!

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:09.570
You almost "did something"
with that little girl, Kuzuha, too!

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:12.900
What are you saying?!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.670
What would've happened
if I hadn't shown up like that?

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:18.210
See what I mean?

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:19.010
You're wrong!

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:20.510
It's not the same thing!

00:18:20.740 --> 00:18:21.770
If you say so.

00:18:22.150 --> 00:18:24.410
But what are you going to
do about the rat trap?

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:26.380
Don't worry, you'll see!

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:31.040
After two nights and three days...

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:34.850
