not without incident though.

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:38.540
Does everybody here
have someone they love?

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:40.720
Now, wait a minute!

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.860
I'm all for romantic relationships!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.960
You can't!
It's against school rules!

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:47.880
C'mon, aren't you lonely when you
don't have someone to love?

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.350
No you are not!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.190
What are you doing
encouraging them?!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.820
Listen to me, I stayed up all night
thinking about this.

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:56.060
Trying to decide
whether you students...

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:58.780
were too young to have
a romantic relationship or not.

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:01.140
I couldn't make up my mind,
one way or the other.

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.630
So then, let me ask you something!

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:06.840
Do you know what makes
the person you love smile?

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.190
Do you know what
makes that person sad?

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:11.530
Do you know what their dreams are?

00:19:12.280 --> 00:19:13.650
If you love someone...

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:16.480
then you must truly cherish
everything about that person...

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.910
from the bottom of your heart!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:21.800
Cherish that person...

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:25.270
If you do, then I promise
the answer will come to you.

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:27.690
Fukae! I believe in you!

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:30.130
Himejima! I believe in you too!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:33.310
That's enough of this!
Those two students are...

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.360
Innocent!

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:34.360
Huh?

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:39.470
I was there taking refuge
from the rain as well...

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:40.950
and I saw those two.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:44.780
Absolutely nothing
happened between them.

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:54.460
No, I don't believe it.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:56.830
Hey, why didn't you
tell us this before?

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:59.500
That would've
taken all the fun out of it.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:15.860
The person...

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:17.570
that I cherish...

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.050
Kuzuha...

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:25.410
Sensei.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:29.710
I wanted to tell you...

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.420
the person I cherish is...

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:53.160
Sensei...

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:04.270
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:20:57.720 --> 00:21:04.470
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:13.630
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:13.630
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:35.590
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:35.590
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:42.480
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:42.480
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:49.330
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:49.330
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:57.310
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:57.310
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:04.440
Even if the sky cries

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:04.440
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:13.280
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:13.280
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:28.040
Okayama's Kibidango dumplings
are really good!!

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:27.990
Welcome to
Okayama Prefecture
-Okayama Tourist Association-

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:53.390
10th Period "Bemusing Love Palette"

00:22:39.100 --> 00:22:40.930
Sensei, we've got a big problem

00:22:40.930 --> 00:22:41.540
What is it?

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:42.750
Please come quickly!

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:43.770
W-What happened?

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:45.960
Just come with me.
Please hurry!

00:22:46.620 --> 00:22:47.800
One, two...

00:22:47.940 --> 00:22:50.850
Happy birthday, Sensei!

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:53.260
Thank you all!
